**So what?** Bucket 0 doesn't move. The test turned a vague "data-arrival trigger" into a concrete requirement, and it caught a "5σ against a₀ ∝ H(z)" headline before it could be written. Before BIG-SPARC and DR4 are registered as triggers, the same sample-size check should be run on them. Some of them may also be undecidable.

